.SH NAME
pocket_scan \- Scan and list USB devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IP
.EX
pocket_scan [\-e]
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scan and list USB devices visible to the host.
On Windows the Cypress CyAPI library is used; on Linux/macOS libusb\-1.0 is used.
The output lists USB address/bus/port, link speed, VID/PID and a device\-name string.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[CR]\-e\f[R]
Show endpoint information (interface, alt\-setting, endpoint, direction, max packet size) for each device.
